@startuml sequence-admin-package-management
title Sequence: Admin Manages Credit Packages (CRUD)

actor       Admin        as A
participant "React SPA"  as SPA  #LightBlue
participant "NestJS API"  as API  #LightGreen
participant "JwtAuthGuard\n+RolesGuard" as GUARD #LightYellow
database    "PostgreSQL"  as DB   #LightSalmon

== Load Admin Packages page ==

A   -> SPA : Navigate to /admin/packages
SPA -> API : GET /api/packages/admin/all\n[Bearer token, role=ADMIN]
API -> GUARD: validate JWT + ADMIN role
GUARD --> API: authorized
API -> DB  : SELECT packages WHERE deleted_at IS NULL
DB --> API : Package[]
SPA -> API : GET /api/packages/features\n[Bearer token, role=ADMIN]
API -> DB  : SELECT features ORDER BY code_name
DB --> API : Feature[]
API --> SPA : packages + features
SPA --> A  : Render table + "New Package" button

== Create Package ==

A   -> SPA : Click "New Package" → fill form\n(name, price, credits, features)
A   -> SPA : Click "Create Package"
SPA -> API : POST /api/packages\n{ name, price, creditAmount, featureIds[] }
API -> GUARD: validate JWT + ADMIN role
GUARD --> API: authorized
API -> DB  : INSERT INTO packages (...)
API -> DB  : INSERT INTO package_features (packageId, featureId) x N
DB --> API : PackageWithFeatures
API --> SPA : 201 Created
SPA --> A  : Close modal, refresh table, Toast success

== Edit Package ==

A   -> SPA : Click "Edit" on a row
SPA --> A  : Open modal pre-filled
A   -> SPA : Modify fields → "Save Changes"
SPA -> API : PATCH /api/packages/:id\n{ name?, price?, featureIds? }
API -> GUARD: validate JWT + ADMIN role
GUARD --> API: authorized
API -> DB  : UPDATE packages SET ... WHERE id=?
API -> DB  : DELETE package_features WHERE packageId=?\nINSERT package_features (new set)
DB --> API : Updated PackageWithFeatures
API --> SPA : 200 OK
SPA --> A  : Close modal, refresh table, Toast success

== Delete Package ==

A   -> SPA : Click "Delete" → "Sure? Yes"
SPA -> API : DELETE /api/packages/:id
API -> GUARD: validate JWT + ADMIN role
GUARD --> API: authorized
API -> DB  : SELECT COUNT(*) FROM user_packages\nWHERE package_id=? AND status='ACTIVE'
alt Active subscribers exist
    DB --> API : count > 0
    API --> SPA : 409 Conflict\n"Cannot delete — N user(s) active"
    SPA --> A  : Toast error
else No active subscribers
    DB --> API : 0
    API -> DB  : UPDATE packages SET deleted_at=NOW(), is_active=false
    DB --> API : OK
    API --> SPA : 200 { message: "Package deleted successfully" }
    SPA --> A  : Remove row, Toast success
end

@enduml
